{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1414769-on-paths-and-connections","id":1414769,"title":"On Paths and Connections","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-20T11:34:47-07:00","id":1414769,"title":"On Paths and Connections","content":"On Scion: Origin's character creation, it states on Step Two (pg 96) that you set up group, contact and access connections for your paths. Under Connections, on page 100, it also states that each Path has one of each type. Do you write them down when creating characters? The book isn't very clear if you create them on-the-fly during play or if you create them during character creation. I was inclined to say during character creation, but the character sheet doesn't even have space for that, but, again, it doesn't have the space for a lot of stuff that you'll need (like 5 slots for Deeds,etc). I know that it does have space for Contacts, but do you write those down, and not the other two types?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24400-endou_kenji","name":"endou_kenji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T13:02:06-07:00","id":1414785,"title":"","content":"It also states that<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Each connection may only be called upon once in a single session. If the Path has already been invoked once this session, you can still invoke it for more dots. The first time you do so, your character gains the Suspended Condition. If you try a second time beyond your limit in the Session, the character gains the Revoked Condition.\u200b </div> </div> </div> Does that mean:<br /> A) you need to invoke your path to invoke a connection<br /> B) you invoke the Path itself and the connections separately for different reasons and results<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24400-endou_kenji","name":"endou_kenji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T13:56:47-07:00","id":1414803,"title":"","content":"On Path examples (page 100+), it suggests that Paths have ranks, but I don't recall seeing that anywhere else. Is that an artifact from a previous incarnation of the rules or am I missing something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24400-endou_kenji","name":"endou_kenji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T14:02:53-07:00","id":1414806,"title":"","content":"Invoking a connection is one of the options of invoking a path. As far as I can tell, creating them on the fly is ok, and probably as it was supposed to be, though you can have a few contacts already made.<br /> <br /> Paths don\u2019t have ranks in Scion, it used to have, and other Storypath games still do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T15:43:58-07:00","id":1414835,"title":"","content":"I wonder if they'll somehow link in Cabalistic pathworking into this. I suppose it would suit the Sorcerer's book when they bring it out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T23:33:44-07:00","id":1414876,"title":"","content":"That's not...remotely the same. At the very least, Paths are static in Scion. No change (let alone growth) exists in current RAW.<br /> While I don't think Scion did paths badly, they don't scale well with play. Trinity does a better job with them, because they don't basically have a single lever that controls the game's power level. So much is tied to Legend, with reason, that there is not a lot room for Paths to do much.<br /> <br /> A fair wack of thought-space that Paths occupy in Trinity Core is taken up with Callings in Scion. Which is a tad odd, given that they do wildly different things. Definitely room for expansion on Paths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-21T05:39:31-07:00","id":1414903,"title":"","content":"While I think Scion is great, I would make Heroes, Demigods, Denizens, etc, all templates to the basics human as in Trinity Core.<br /> <br /> The utilities of Edges and Expansive Paths are different from callings, and it would allow characters to evolve sideways instead of only up. But I would keep Callings (and Knacks), Boons and Titles locked to Legend, otherwise the gods would be stated as \u201cmark all\u201d, as happened to high level Novas in Aberrant 1e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}